Package: pengu-deck
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio
Suggests: pipewire-jack | jackd2
Description: Two deck DJ software with local files and SoundCloud streaming
 Pengu Deck is a lightweight DJ application for Linux with two decks,
 coloured waveforms, BPM detection, sync, loops, hot cues, a three band
 EQ mixer with kills and filter, keylock, headphone cueing, recording
 and SoundCloud search and streaming.
